quarters, down 16.0% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 76.3%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($35.9m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 76.3% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $35.9m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"Net cash of $90.4m against total assets of $231.1m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-1.5% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 16.0% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-3.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $1.4m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"Debt of $82.9m against equity of $75.3m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806201/000180620126000038/0001806201-26-000038-index.htm","accession":"0001806201-26-000038"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 68.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.68,"consecutive":2,"current":0.763,"current_display":"76.3%","threshold_display":"68.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -31.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.31,"consecutive":2,"current":-0.16,"current_display":"-16.0%","threshold_display":"-31.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":-0.015,"current_display":"-1.5%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share 